    "title": "Head-on crash in Franklin County leaves two seriously injured - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Maia Orme ,\n10 hours ago Two people were injured in a car crash in Franklin County early Wednesday morning. The Missouri State Highway Patrol (MSHP) reported the crash happened at 1:07 a.m. on Highway 100, west of St. Johns Road. According to the crash report, a 2004 Chrysler PT Cruiser crossed into the westbound lanes... Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 6",
